  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kingdom of Wow</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">KOW Lifestyle footwear is a social brand with a dedicated and responsibly run manufacturing facility in Cambodia. KOW employs mainly uneducated women who have little chance to find safe and fair employment in the formal economy. The goal is to increase sales to increase the volume of the production in Cambodia. Growth would mean employing more women and providing them with a living wage and opportunities for professional development.</narrative>
  </description>
